flowchart LR
    OSM[OpenStreetMap] --> DL[Download]
    HIFLD[HIFLD lines] --> DL
    FEMA[FEMA flood zones] --> DL
    DL --> FT[Convert to US feet]
    FT --> DB[(PostGIS)]
    DB --> LOC[Conflation check]
    DB --> CON[Network connectivity]
    DB --> ATT[Attribute checks]
    LOC --> F[Findings]
    CON --> F
    ATT --> F
    F --> RANK[Rank by flood risk]
    RANK --> CSV[Findings report]
    RANK --> MAP[QA map]
    DL --> VER[Independent recount]
    VER -. same features .-> F
